            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>In an image displaying apparatus, comprising: a large-size housing; and a panel module 100, having a thin plate-like 110 frame having a rectangular shape in an outer configuration thereof, and a display element, which is mounted on the frame, and being attached on the housing, wherein on a flange portion 111, which is formed along with an outer periphery of said thin plate-like frame building up the panel module, is further formed a reinforcement portion 112, through bending that flange portion into a predetermined shape in the cross-section configuration thereof, through a squeezing process, or pipe-like members 400 fixed along the outer periphery of the frame, and "L"-shaped members 420, each being fixed between the cylindrical members neighboring with each other, thereby providing the structures of the panel module, being superior in the mechanical strength thereof, in spite of an increase of area thereof, simply and cheaply.</p>
            </abstract>
